  "details": "In live, it is possible to reparent an object with the VRC_Pickup script. In open beta, reparenting this object does nothing. This breaks the new climbing mechanic for Desktop users.\n\nLive:\nhttps://gyazo.com/f4ac052461390768e04c273df6349791\n\nOpen Beta:\nhttps://gyazo.com/6cbd92d9bf2b970777f81c67fabdbe05 \n\nYou can test on any climbing map: \nRapunzel - wrld_98400948-004d-44b8-9dea-293a3badf70f\nThe Depths - wrld_dae5e150-d663-4397-9431-a581f5f49271\nSky Temple - wrld_ad74d280-1d2c-4baa-b2fe-f463e16f05cc\nColossus - wrld_c631055c-edeb-4ddb-a3d4-09b1dcb7a0a5",
